{"file":"resend-1.0.5-v2.zip","bytes":181543,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"resend","description":"Send and receive emails, build with React Email, follow deliverability best practices","version":"1.0.5","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/resend/resend-skills","homepage":"https://resend.com","keywords":["email","resend","smtp","notifications","agent-inbox"]},{"path":".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","name":"resend","displayName":"Resend","description":"Skills and MCP server for the Resend email platform — sending, receiving, templates, CLI, React Email, and deliverability best practices.","version":"1.0.4","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/resend/resend-skills","homepage":"https://resend.com","keywords":["email","resend","smtp","notifications","agent-inbox"]},{"path":".grok-plugin/plugin.json","name":"resend","description":"Resend skills for Grok — send, receive, and manage email: transactional and batch sending, inbound email agents, React Email templates, the Resend CLI, and deliverability best practices.","version":"1.0.4","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/resend/resend-skills","homepage":"https://resend.com/","keywords":["resend","email","transactional-email","inbound-email","react-email","deliverability"]},{"path":"plugin.json","name":"resend","description":"Send and receive emails, build with React Email, follow deliverability best practices","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/resend/resend-skills","homepage":"https://resend.com","keywords":["email","resend","smtp","notifications","agent-inbox"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/agent-email-inbox/SKILL.md","name":"agent-email-inbox","description":"Use when building any system where email content triggers actions — AI agent inboxes, automated support handlers, email-to-task pipelines, or any workflow processing untrusted inbound email. Always use this skill when the user wants to receive emails and act on them programmatically, even if they don't mention \"agent\" — the skill contains critical security patterns (sender allowlists, content filtering, sandboxed processing) that prevent untrusted email from controlling your system.","headings":["AI Agent Email Inbox","Overview","Why Webhook-Based Receiving?","Architecture","SDK Version Requirements","Quick Start","Before You Start: Account & API Key Setup","First Question: New or Existing Resend Account?","Creating API Keys Securely","Domain-Scoped API Keys (Recommended for Existing Accounts)","Domain Setup","Option 1: Resend-Managed Domain (Recommended for Getting Started)","Option 2: Custom Domain","Security Levels","Level 1: Strict Allowlist (Recommended)","Security Best Practices","Webhook Endpoint","Next.js App Router"],"name_hint":"智能体 · 邮件 · inbox","description_zh":"设计让邮件内容触发操作的系统，如代理收件箱、自动客服与邮件转任务流程；通过发件人允许列表、内容过滤及沙箱处理，防止不可信入站邮件控制系统。"},{"path":"skills/email-best-practices/SKILL.md","name":"email-best-practices","description":"Use when building email features, emails going to spam, high bounce rates, setting up SPF/DKIM/DMARC authentication, implementing email capture, ensuring compliance (CAN-SPAM, GDPR, CASL), handling webhooks, retry logic, making emails accessible (alt text, headings, contrast, screen readers), or deciding transactional vs marketing.","headings":["Email Best Practices","Architecture Overview","Quick Reference","Start Here"],"name_hint":"邮件 · best · practices","description_zh":"建设邮件功能并排查垃圾邮件和高退信率，配置 SPF、DKIM、DMARC，处理邮件收集、webhook、重试及无障碍展示，并区分事务邮件与营销邮件；原说明涵盖 CAN-SPAM、GDPR、CASL 合规。"},{"path":"skills/react-email/SKILL.md","name":"react-email","description":"Use when building HTML email templates with React components, adding a visual email editor to an application using the React Email visual editor, rendering emails to HTML, or sending emails with Resend. Covers welcome emails, password resets, notifications, order confirmations, newsletters, transactional emails, and the embeddable email editor component.","headings":["React Email","Installation","Adding to an Existing Project","Basic Email Template","Behavioral Guidelines","Essential Components","Before Writing Code","Static Files and Images","Directory Structure","Dev vs Production URLs","Styling","Key Rules","Required Classes","Structure Notes","Rendering","Convert to HTML","Convert to Plain Text","Sending"],"name_hint":"react · 邮件","description_zh":"使用 React 组件构建 HTML 邮件模板、渲染为 HTML 或通过 Resend 发送，并将 React Email 可视化编辑器嵌入应用；适用于欢迎、密码重置、通知、订单确认、通讯及事务邮件。"},{"path":"skills/resend-cli/SKILL.md","name":"resend-cli","description":"Operate the Resend platform from the terminal — send emails (including React Email .tsx templates via --react-email), manage domains, contacts, broadcasts, templates, webhooks, API keys, logs, automations, and events via the `resend` CLI. Use when the user wants to run Resend commands in the shell, scripts, or CI/CD pipelines, or send/preview React Email templates. Always load this skill before running `resend` commands — it contains the non-interactive flag contract and gotchas that prevent silent failures.","headings":["Resend CLI","Installation","Agent Protocol","Authentication","Global Flags","Available Commands","Common Mistakes","Common Patterns","Configure DNS records from output, then:","RESEND_API_KEY is injected by the CI secret store — never hardcode it","When to Load References"],"name_hint":"resend · cli","description_zh":"通过 resend CLI 在终端、脚本或 CI/CD 操作邮件平台，发送或预览含 React Email .tsx 的模板，并管理域名、联系人、广播、模板、webhook、API key、日志、自动化和事件；包含非交互参数约定及常见失败陷阱。"},{"path":"skills/resend/SKILL.md","name":"resend","description":"Use when working with the Resend email API — sending transactional emails (single or batch), receiving inbound emails via webhooks, managing email templates, tracking delivery events, managing domains, contacts, broadcasts, webhooks, API keys, automations, events, viewing API request logs, or setting up the Resend SDK. Always use this skill when the user mentions Resend, even for simple tasks like \"send an email with Resend\" — the skill contains critical gotchas (idempotency keys, webhook verification, template variable syntax) that prevent common production issues.","headings":["Resend","Quick Send — Node.js","Quick Send — Python","Single vs Batch Decision","Idempotency Keys (Critical for Retries)","Quick Receive (Node.js)","What Do You Need?","SDK Version Requirements","Common Setup","API Key","Detect Project Language","Common Mistakes","Cross-Cutting Concerns","Send + Receive Together","AI Agent Inbox","Marketing Emails","Domain Warm-up","Testing"],"name_hint":"resend","description_zh":"使用 Resend API 或 SDK 发送单封、批量事务邮件，接收入站 webhook，管理模板、域名、联系人、广播、密钥、自动化与事件，并查看请求日志和投递情况；涵盖幂等键、webhook 校验及模板变量语法。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Resend Skills","Install","Available Skills","MCP Server","Plugins","Editing skills","Prerequisites","License"]}],"mcp_servers":["resend","resend"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/marketplace.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".github/workflows/sync-from-repo.yml",".github/workflows/sync-prs-to-linear.yml",".gitignore",".grok-plugin/plugin.json","AGENTS.md","CLAUDE.md","LICENSE","README.md","assets/app-icon.svg","mcp.json","plugin.json","skill-evals/agent-email-inbox/evals.json","skill-evals/resend/evals.json","skills/agent-email-inbox/SKILL.md","skills/agent-email-inbox/references/advanced-patterns.md","skills/agent-email-inbox/references/security-levels.md","skills/agent-email-inbox/references/webhook-setup.md","skills/email-best-practices/SKILL.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/accessibility.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/compliance.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/deliverability.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/email-capture.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/email-types.md","skills/email-best-practices/references/list-management.md